    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_tanya_kevatei_rybl",
     "kind": "tanya_kevatei",
     "gloss_en": "ותניא כוותיה דרבי יהושע בן לוי: why did they say shacharit until midday, minchah until evening, arvit without fixed time, musaf all day? -- because the corresponding offering runs so",
